                    "value": "Cap discounts at 30% and require manager approval above it. Orders discounted more than 30% brought in $1.55M of sales but a $793.5K loss, while all other orders earned $2.26M profit. The three loss-making regions average 35–43% discount (vs 5–9% in the best regions), and Tables average 29%. Tightening discount policy there and re-pricing Furniture / Tables should lift total profit without needing more sales.",
